C-Basic:

c is a compiler time based language, Procedural orientedlanguage, it is a mid level langugage.

In c language ,
step 1: build the compilation : it compiles from top to bottom.(during compile time compiler will check for syntax and symmentics)
step 2: Execution : it is from main function 

